# Hồn Việt: Mộng Giới — normalize line endings.
# The build patches anchor on LF regex markers inside index.html/battle.html and
# several tests compare built bytes; CRLF checkouts break them (2026-09-27).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets are binary; never let git touch their bytes.
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
